only an email field. If they put in their email and they press Continue, then they can put
in the password as well"). Closing Google's account sheet changes nothing.
Changing the server, Access credentials or account source MUST reset retained form
inputs and revoke pending sign-in authority before another request or session commit.
The form's displayed server and inputs MUST belong to its opening source, including
through a modal exit animation (21 Oct 2026 first-run review, direct server recovery).
Tavi's 21 Oct 2026 anonymous browsing decision adds a working Browse public projects
action to setup/sign-in; selecting it MUST preserve a legitimate saved private account
and retire its current page/request authority without signing out.

